Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:07.18,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Linka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:10.98,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,You wiped out those goblins \Nin just a few minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.57,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,You really are—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.75,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Linka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:23.89,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Mr. Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:30.01,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I got too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:36.51,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I've never sustained my \Nskill for so long before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:38.19,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Linka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:41.41,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:45.79,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,You're both so pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.43,Signs,EMPEE,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\fnGeorgia\bord2\blur5\pos(108.445,114.222)\c&H98905C&\3c&HFFED6A&}Magic\NRepo Man
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.43,Signs,EMPEE,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\fnGeorgia\bord2\blur5\c&H98905C&\3c&HFFED6A&\pos(343.445,112.222)}Dumped by My Party, I'll Cash In With a\NCute Support Fairy to Become the Strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.43,0:01:03.04,Signs,EMPEE,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,000)\fnGeorgia\pos(108.445,114.222)}Magic\N{\c&H1D1EFF&}Repo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Man
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.43,0:01:03.04,Signs,EMPEE,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,000)\fnGeorgia\c&H1D1EFF&\pos(356.132,115.838)}Dumped {\c&HFFFFFF&}by My Party, I'll Cash In {\c&H1D1EFF&}With a\NCute {\c&HFFFFFF&}Support Fairy to Become the {\c&H1D1EFF&}Strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:20.51,Default,PANNA,0,0,0,,You have 1,043 goblin \NMagic Stones in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.72,Default,PANNA,0,0,0,,All together, that's 104,300 gol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.72,Signs,PANNA,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,500)\blur1\3c&H2E2E2E&\4c&H848487&\fnGeorgia\alpha20\bord1\pos(553,275)}"Reunion"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:27.99,Default,PANNA,0,0,0,,You have 18 goblin leader \NMagic Stones worth 9,000 gol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:33.00,Default,PANNA,0,0,0,,You have 18 goblin seeds from destroying \Ncolonies worth 36,000 gol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.51,Default,PANNA,0,0,0,,Here's your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:37.97,Default,ADVENTURER A,0,0,0,,That's amazing. You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:40.20,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,She did all the work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:44.77,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,This is incredible, Mr. Lent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.77,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,T-Today alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:51.27,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,my maximum MP increased \Nby four whole points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:52.77,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:56.15,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,It's been three years since \NI became an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.78,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'd only gained two points until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:03.66,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,This is all because of you, Mr. Lent.\N Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:08.17,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,All I did was lend a hand.\NYou did it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:12.42,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I still can't believe \Nwhat happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:16.58,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,You really are strong. \NYou should hold your head high.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.45,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Mr. Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:21.60,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. Sorry to interrupt,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:25.67,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,but I have news regarding \NMs. Linka's MP loans today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.67,0:03:31.21,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,She activated her skill 18 \Ntimes for a total of 126 MP.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:34.78,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Her total active duration was one hour,\N 21 minutes, and 40 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:38.18,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,She consumes one MP every ten seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:42.44,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,so that's a combined total of 616 MP.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:46.45,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'll get even stronger \Nand pay it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:48.72,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Additionally, your interest rate is 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:51.11,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,There's no deadline on repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.45,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:57.41,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, when's the last time \Nsomeone thanked me for using my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:03:59.89,Flashback,GUY,0,0,0,,Our skills leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:01.57,Flashback,MISA,0,0,0,,This is because of you, Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:03.17,Flashback,GUY & MISA,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:05.31,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,I won't screw up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:08.00,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,This time, we'll get stronger together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.43,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:13.86,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,To celebrate the formation of your party, \Nlet's get something tasty to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.38,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,You're right.\NLinka, what would you like to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:19.94,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Meat! I love meat!\NFlour-based foods are good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:24.91,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\shad1\bord2\p1\alpha&H50&\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&HB7B7B7&\fscx82\fscy36\pos(317.527,189.054)}m 0 0 l 268 0 268 88 0 88
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:24.91,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\bord0\fs13\c&H151515&\fnTimes New Roman\pos(318.804,191.497)}Melva Labyrinth\NEighth Floor "Wyvern Mountains"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.55,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:34.85,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Aegis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.78,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,This isn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:48.18,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Then we'll just have to \Nbring it down. Namilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.30,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.30,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Physical Boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.65,0:05:07.24,Default,FUUGA,0,0,0,,Heavenly Thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:14.25,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Fall! Comet Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:28.31,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Welcome to the ground, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:31.01,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Let's give it a warm welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.51,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Speed Boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.66,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\shad1\bord2\p1\alpha&H50&\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&HB7B7B7&\fscx86\fscy34\pos(318.527,210.054)}m 0 0 l 268 0 268 88 0 88
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.66,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\bord0\fs13\c&H151515&\fnTimes New Roman\pos(318.804,211.497)}Skill: War Cry\NShout to draw the enemy's attention
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.33,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Block Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.05,Default,FUUGA,0,0,0,,Piercing Flurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.71,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Comet, send me into the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:09.98,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Whirlwind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:15.94,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Skill Boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.39,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Mighty Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.28,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,These are big and heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:38.00,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Just removing one takes a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:41.44,Default,FUUGA,0,0,0,,We need 30 of these scales for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.81,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Thirty?! We've got our work cut out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:48.71,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Who knew gathering the materials would \Nbe harder than slaying the wyvern?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.21,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:56.63,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Roger, is that where you've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:57.60,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.43,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,I brought back the wyvern's liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:03.97,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you went \Ninside that thing's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:08.23,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Its stomach acid nearly melted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:12.47,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,You idiot! I'm always telling \Nyou not to do dangerous stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:13.80,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:23.75,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,There were parasites inside the wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:27.47,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Oh, please! Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:29.66,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Stop making weird noises, Namilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.04,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,And Comet, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:34.21,Default,JIN,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.56,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:42.55,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Dinner with Meteor Shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.01,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:47.33,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.56,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Mr. Roger invited me the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:54.33,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be a good \Nchance for you to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:58.34,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't! I'm just a \Nweakling F-rank adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.64,Top,LINKA,0,0,0,,I don't deserve a seat at that table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:02.38,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,You'll tear your head off, \Nshaking it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:07.20,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Mr. Lent, are you actually\Nacquainted with Meteor Shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.08,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:13.11,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I've had drinks with them a few \Ntimes since the Skypiercers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:16.01,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,started receiving attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:18.80,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:23.54,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Now that we're in a party together, \NI wanted to introduce you to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.96,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm still going to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:32.61,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to intrude \Non your reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:34.11,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:38.97,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Mr. Lent, have fun on my behalf tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:50.21,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,It's been a while since \NI last drank with Mr. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:53.07,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,I'm excited, but I'm \Nalso kind of nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.50,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.15,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Ms. Namilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.13,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Didn't you just come \Nback from an adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:08.53,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,We're drinking with you tonight, \Nso I thought I'd get dressed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.03,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,What do you think of this outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:18.91,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I-I think it's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:22.15,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Come on, take a proper look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.66,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Look at you blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:28.42,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,You're always so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.56,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:35.01,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,What's with the stupid getup?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.31,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,How could you? These \Nare my nicest clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:41.74,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Hey, Lent's face is \Nturning a crazy color!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:44.26,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.78,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Another ale, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.00,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,One for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:53.20,Default,WAITRESS,0,0,0,,Two ales. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:56.58,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,I'll pass out if I try \Nto keep up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:59.56,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:10.63,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Lent, I've heard all kinds of \Nrumors about the Skypiercers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.89,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Like how they kicked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:16.17,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,That must've been tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:21.95,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Sorry for ruining the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.05,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Anyway, that was awful of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:27.81,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,You were together for five years, \Nand they just kicked you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:32.37,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,I haven't heard anything good \Nabout those idiots recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:35.56,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,They must've run out of luck \Nwhen they kicked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:39.81,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Your skill lets you \Nloan people MP, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:43.82,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,They seem to have forgotten how \Nmuch they were relying on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.62,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,You were the quickest \Nparty to reach rank B.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:50.34,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Yeah. Of course that went \Nstraight to their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:55.08,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, I \Nmay have been relying on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:59.72,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I could adventure just by standing \Nin the back and using my skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:03.22,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I never considered forging my own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.76,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,It's no wonder they kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:09.83,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I really was incompetent back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.11,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Lent, you've toughened up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.86,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,What? You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.94,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:21.87,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,But I don't agree that you \Nused to be incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:27.37,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Do you remember how we first met?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:32.99,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Yes. It was before you \Njoined Meteor Shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.76,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:38.62,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I was at a lively guild \Nbar just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:44.14,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I'd actually just ditched my party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:47.67,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,In a heated argument, I told \Nthem they were holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.93,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd drink my \Nanger away, when...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:52.70,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Is this seat taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:53.94,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,No, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:57.52,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I'm Namilia. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:11:58.94,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:02.45,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I just came back from an \Nadventure. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:03.95,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:08.50,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Really? You don't look \Nlike much of a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:12.51,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,That's true. I'm a support class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.88,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,So you let your party take care of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:20.91,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I'm a support class, too, but \NI do my best to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:23.95,Flashback,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Don't you think about doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:28.47,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,Of course it'd be great if I were strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:31.13,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,but my skill lets me make \Nmy allies stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:35.68,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,I'd rather make them strong \Nthan become strong myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:38.23,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,After all, supporting them is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:47.19,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,I realized then that it wasn't my \Nparty's fault things hadn't gone well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:54.60,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Your words made me realize I was only \Nusing self-centered enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:59.95,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,So don't call your old \Nself incompetent, Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:01.96,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:05.90,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Anyway, compared to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:08.67,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,our leader's still just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:09.97,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:12.73,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,The other day, after we \Ndefeated a wyvern...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:17.90,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,A w-wyvern? Don't those appear on \Nthe eighth floor of the labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:21.23,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,We're working on clearing \Nthe eighth floor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:26.49,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Th-That's incredible. That area's \Nteeming with powerful dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:30.89,Top,ROGER,0,0,0,,Those lizards don't stand \Na chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:32.10,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,Mr. Roger and Ms. Namilia far \Noutclass me as adventurers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:33.49,Top,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Anyway, after we defeated the wyvern,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:35.49,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,but they're still excited \Nto tell me their tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:37.50,Top,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Roger caused a huge commotion while \Nwe were gathering materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:37.50,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,It's almost like we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:41.51,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,Oh, right. This is the kind of \Nadventurer I wanted to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:46.71,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Anyway, we plan to finish clearing \Nthe eighth floor on our next visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.26,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:53.26,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Our goal is the bottom floor \Nof the Melva Labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.17,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,The bottom floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:58.27,Italic,LENT/ID,0,0,0,,The ultimate destination \Nof many an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:14:02.04,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,By the way, how many floors \Ndoes the labyrinth have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:04.78,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Nobody knows exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:08.79,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Then, we'll be the ones to\Nfully uncover the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:12.49,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I actually \Nhave news to share, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:16.60,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Did you form a new party?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:17.50,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:18.29,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:22.54,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I teamed up with someone named Linka, \Nwho was also abandoned by her party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:24.66,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,That girl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.21,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:31.82,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,we're rivals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:36.06,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.67,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Thanks for the drinks, Mr. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:40.48,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:45.23,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Aw, we missed our chance to ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:51.74,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,We can't ask him to join Meteor Shower \Nwhen he just formed a new party, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.24,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:57.24,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\shad1\bord2\p1\alpha&H50&\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&HB7B7B7&\fscx49\fscy35\pos(317.527,232.054)}m 0 0 l 268 0 268 88 0 88
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:57.24,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\bord0\fs13\c&H151515&\fnTimes New Roman\pos(317.804,239.497)}Two Years Earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:57.24,Flashback,ROGER,0,0,0,,We'll be leaving this place for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:02.12,Flashback,ROGER,0,0,0,,Once we're strong enough to take \Non the eighth floor, we'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.50,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:10.23,Flashback,ROGER,0,0,0,,So, I have a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:11.46,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:13.94,Flashback,ROGER,0,0,0,,Would you like to join Meteor Shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:15.56,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:20.58,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer. \NIt's more than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:25.54,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,But I've been with my party ever \Nsince I started adventuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:30.93,Flashback,LENT,0,0,0,,I couldn't abandon them for another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:39.78,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,He wouldn't abandon the Skypiercers \Neven after they treated him terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:42.00,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,It was pointless to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:46.93,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Then we could recruit him and the \Nnew girl he formed a party with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:51.67,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,One of my old drinking \Nbuddies was a moneylender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:56.96,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,He didn't trust anyone else, \Nand he started profiteering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:16:00.07,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,As a result, he had people \Neverywhere who hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:03.68,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,In the end, he was killed by some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:06.78,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Lent's gift is Loan Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:10.16,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,To some, that might be more \Nappealing than borrowing money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.98,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,I was worried getting kicked \Nout would make him distrustful,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:17.35,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,and he'd follow the same path...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.71,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,but he's got a new ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:25.25,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,He'll be fine, so he doesn't \Nneed to join... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:29.98,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Lent, why don't we drink \Nsome more after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:33.51,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Linka's waiting \Nfor me at the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:37.04,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,She'll worry if I'm out too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:41.04,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you head-over-heels for Linka now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.71,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,No. We're party members, \Nbut we're not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:50.25,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind something casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.89,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Leave Lent alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:57.37,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,What? I just asked Lent to \Njoin me for more drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.88,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,By the way, Lent, what \Nare you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:03.47,Default,NAMILIA,0,0,0,,Is your inn the same direction as ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.28,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I actually have a request \Nfor Meteor Shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:15.12,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,As I expected, they arrived \Nin exactly three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:19.55,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,I should have my master \Npurchase {\i1}that{\i0} soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:25.64,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Yggdrasil knows everything \Nabout his debtors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.94,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,These skewers are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:41.45,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\shad1\bord2\p1\alpha&H50&\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&HB7B7B7&\pos(318.527,175.054)\fscx96\fscy44}m 0 0 l 268 0 268 88 0 88
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:41.45,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\bord0\fs13\c&H151515&\fnTimes New Roman\pos(318.804,174.497)}Melvian Dog\NInside: Raging Bull Sausage\NOutside: Deep-fried Batter
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.96,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,They're the local guild's specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:47.45,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,They're flour-based, \Njust how I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:50.88,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'm always starving after \NI use First Strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.97,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I could eat a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:57.71,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Very good. They say children who \Neat a lot grow up big and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:59.97,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,You eat a lot, too, Empee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:04.41,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,By the way, Ms. Linka, don't \Nyou have news for my master?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.10,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:13.32,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\fs16\c&H000000&\frz3.119\pos(185,115)}Linka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:13.32,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\fs16\c&H000000&\frz2.771\pos(158,148)}Asura\NRealm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:13.32,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\fs10\c&H000000&\frz2.771\pos(244,194)}Adventurer Rank: E
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:13.32,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\fs10\c&H000000&\frz2.771\pos(247,216)}Party: Twice Exceptional
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:10.64,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,As of today, my adventurer rank has risen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:12.36,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'm rank E now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:17.36,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Wow, you leveled up in just four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:21.80,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Yes. My maximum MP also rose to 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:28.54,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I can't believe I can confidently \Nadventure with the gift I once resented.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:31.47,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Mr. Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:36.47,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Until recently, I felt the \Nsame way about my own gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:43.23,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Then allow me to give you \Na gift to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.32,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:49.23,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,It's the crunchy part of the Melvian \Ndog you just sloppily ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:53.14,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,It's the tastiest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:54.22,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:58.73,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,In fact, the rest of the dog \Nis just a prelude to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.09,0:19:06.83,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,It's so fragrant and delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.35,Default,EMPEE,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.58,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:21.34,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Hey, Lent. We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:24.97,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,What do you want? I thought \Nyou were finished with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:27.19,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:32.92,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,You've been stealing our MP.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:35.09,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,You're behind all of this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:38.57,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Stealing? You're the \Nones who stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:43.44,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,I didn't give you that MP.\N I loaned it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:50.08,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Because you gave no indication you'd \Nreturn it, I just collected it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:52.03,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:54.92,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:59.16,Default,LINKA,0,0,0,,I'm someone who adventures with Mr. Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:01.67,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.72,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,You're pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:05.69,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:06.35,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:07.75,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:11.95,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Now, now. If you're going \Nto fight, take it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:13.78,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.76,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:17.77,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Look at the mess you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:20.70,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,What a waste of good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.27,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,You gotta hear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:26.85,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,This idiot has been harassing \Nus with some weird spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:28.14,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,A weird spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:30.71,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,He's stealing our MP!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:34.65,Default,ELLE,0,0,0,,He's punishing us for kicking \Nhim out of the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:37.66,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,You guys had been borrowing MP from Lent
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:40.71,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,and using that power to adventure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:44.50,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,When you borrow something, you \Nreturn it. That's how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:46.58,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:50.49,Default,MISA,0,0,0,,But he did it without our consent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.49,0:20:51.92,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:55.30,Default,LENT,0,0,0,,Yes, since they were so malicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:21:01.48,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,I see. Collecting debt too \Naggressively can cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:05.45,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:10.95,Default,ROGER,0,0,0,,You'll duel to settle the matter.

